  "raw_text": "Step 1: Calculate the total gallons of gasoline used by the SUV.\nStep 2: Calculate the total gallons of gasoline that would have been used by the hybrid car.\nStep 3: Subtract the gallons used by the hybrid car from the gallons used by the SUV to find the gallons saved.\n\nStep 1: Total gallons used by the SUV = Total miles driven / Miles per gallon of SUV\nStep 2: Total gallons used by the hybrid car = Total miles driven / Miles per gallon of hybrid car\n\nStep 1: 12,000 miles / 15 mpg = 800 gallons\nStep 2: 12,000 miles / 48 mpg = 250 gallons\n\nStep 3: 800 gallons - 250 gallons = 550 gallons\n\nFinal answer: \\boxed{550}<|im_end|>",
